{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Island Treasure</strong></i> &quot;is the first game developed by Guohe Studio. The game is a casual game that combines action and decryption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/\u5236\u4f5c\u7535\u5f71\u6d77\u62a5__6_.png?t=1748312362\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Action</strong>: Run, jump and avoid traps, get a sword and defeat the devil</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/\u63cf\u8ff03GIf.gif?t=1748312362\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/\u63cf\u8ff05GIf.gif?t=1748312362\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/\u63cf\u8ff04GIf.gif?t=1748312362\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Decryption</strong>: Search for treasure chests, obtain keys and treasures, and find the map to the next level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/\u63cf\u8ff01GIf.gif?t=1748312362\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/extras/\u63cf\u8ff02GIf.gif?t=1748312362\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Perhaps acquiring a certain ability is the key to unlocking a secret~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We hope you enjoy this game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3745650?t=1748312362","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745650/43d84f033f0bd1521040a6089dce9eede5736b90/page_bg_raw.jpg?t